    <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Both parties—client representative and carrier inspector—must sign the sheet, acknowledging that the vehicle has been inspected and accepted as described.</span></li>
    <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Attach the signed sheet to the final LR bilty and upload a scanned copy to the transport management system.</span></li>
